 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.4667,
   "text": "In this town, everyone wore a pumpkin on their head."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.bed",
   "start": 2.4667,
   "end": 4.1,
   "text": "All day. Even in bed."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.who",
   "start": 4.1,
   "end": 5.5667,
   "text": "Nobody knew who had started it."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.mother",
   "start": 5.5667,
   "end": 7.4,
   "text": "Nobody knew what their own mother looked like."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.why",
   "start": 7.4,
   "end": 9.3667,
   "text": "And nobody would tell me why we could never take them off."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.soup",
   "start": 9.3667,
   "end": 12.1333,
   "text": "We ate soup through the mouth hole, with a very long spoon."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.shoes",
   "start": 12.1333,
   "end": 13.6,
   "text": "We told each other apart by our shoes."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.knock",
   "start": 13.6,
   "end": 15.9333,
   "text": "And we said hello by knocking twice on each other's heads."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.carve",
   "start": 15.9333,
   "end": 19.0333,
   "text": "Every autumn, the oldest woman carved a new pumpkin for every baby."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.golem",
   "start": 19.0333,
   "end": 20.8,
   "text": "An iron golem walked the street all night,"
  },
  {
   "id": "3.ground",
   "start": 20.8,
   "end": 22.6,
   "text": "and it never once looked up from the ground."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.liked",
   "start": 22.6,
   "end": 23.8333,
   "text": "I liked it there, mostly."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.wish",
   "start": 23.8333,
   "end": 25.8,
   "text": "But I had never seen my own face."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.what",
   "start": 25.8,
   "end": 26.5,
   "text": "What did I look like?"
  },
  {
   "id": "5.ask",
   "start": 26.5,
   "end": 29.1667,
   "text": "So I asked the oldest woman, the one who had carved mine."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.tap",
   "start": 29.1667,
   "end": 31.3,
   "text": "She tapped her pumpkin for a long time."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.rule",
   "start": 31.3,
   "end": 34.7333,
   "text": "Then she said, \"We keep them on. That is all I was ever told.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "5.away",
   "start": 34.7333,
   "end": 36.6,
   "text": "And she went inside and shut the door."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.sleep",
   "start": 36.6,
   "end": 38.4,
   "text": "That night, I could not sleep."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.plant",
   "start": 38.4,
   "end": 40.6333,
   "text": "Who was a whole town hiding its face from?"
  },
  {
   "id": "6.decide",
   "start": 40.6333,
   "end": 42.2,
   "text": "I decided to take mine off and see."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.well",
   "start": 42.2,
   "end": 45.0,
   "text": "The next morning, I leaned over the well to find my reflection."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.back",
   "start": 45.0,
   "end": 46.4667,
   "text": "A pumpkin looked back."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.lift",
   "start": 46.4667,
   "end": 48.8667,
   "text": "So I grabbed mine with both hands and started to lift."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.hands",
   "start": 48.8667,
   "end": 52.8667,
   "text": "I got it as far as my chin. Then twenty hands pushed it back down."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.rope",
   "start": 52.8667,
   "end": 55.0667,
   "text": "My mother tied it on with rope for a week."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.moon",
   "start": 55.0667,
   "end": 56.7,
   "text": "So I waited for a night with a full moon,"
  },
  {
   "id": "8.window",
   "start": 56.7,
   "end": 59.5,
   "text": "when the whole town was asleep, and climbed out of my window."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.friend",
   "start": 59.5,
   "end": 61.1333,
   "text": "My best friend was standing at her window."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.knock",
   "start": 61.1333,
   "end": 62.5667,
   "text": "She knocked twice on the glass."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.shook",
   "start": 62.5667,
   "end": 64.4333,
   "text": "Then she shook her pumpkin. No."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.street",
   "start": 64.4333,
   "end": 66.4667,
   "text": "The street was empty and very quiet."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.golem",
   "start": 66.4667,
   "end": 69.0333,
   "text": "The golem walked past me with its eyes on its feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.holes",
   "start": 69.0333,
   "end": 71.4333,
   "text": "Through two small holes, at night, I could hardly see a thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.look",
   "start": 71.4333,
   "end": 73.9333,
   "text": "I looked back at the houses one more time."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.asleep",
   "start": 73.9333,
   "end": 76.9,
   "text": "Every window was dark. Every pumpkin was asleep."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.knelt",
   "start": 76.9,
   "end": 79.2333,
   "text": "Then I knelt at the well, took a deep breath,"
  },
  {
   "id": "10.off",
   "start": 79.2333,
   "end": 80.6333,
   "text": "and pulled it off."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.air",
   "start": 80.6333,
   "end": 83.3333,
   "text": "For a second, all I felt was cold air on my cheeks."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.face",
   "start": 83.3333,
   "end": 86.4,
   "text": "Then the moon came out, and there I was in the water."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.nose",
   "start": 86.4,
   "end": 88.7333,
   "text": "A nose. Two eyes. A chin."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.smile",
   "start": 88.7333,
   "end": 90.8,
   "text": "I had a face, and it was smiling."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.behind",
   "start": 90.8,
   "end": 93.3667,
   "text": "I was about to laugh when I saw what was standing behind my reflection."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.tall",
   "start": 93.3667,
   "end": 96.2,
   "text": "It was tall, and thin, and darker than the night."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.every",
   "start": 96.2,
   "end": 97.7,
   "text": "There was one beside every house,"
  },
  {
   "id": "13.windows",
   "start": 97.7,
   "end": 99.8333,
   "text": "and every one of them was facing a window."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.always",
   "start": 99.8333,
   "end": 101.2,
   "text": "They had always been there."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.eyes",
   "start": 101.2,
   "end": 104.5333,
   "text": "The pumpkins were never hiding our faces. They were hiding our eyes."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.find",
   "start": 104.5333,
   "end": 106.5667,
   "text": "They cannot find you until you look at them."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.looked",
   "start": 106.5667,
   "end": 108.6,
   "text": "And I had just looked."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.turned",
   "start": 108.6,
   "end": 111.1333,
   "text": "One by one, every head turned to me."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.still",
   "start": 111.1333,
   "end": 114.1333,
   "text": "The closest one has not moved yet. Neither have I."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.sub",
   "start": 114.1333,
   "end": 115.9333,
   "text": "Subscribe before I blink."
  }
 ],
